<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise cable unit aims for breakeven.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise cable unit aims for breakeven.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyonnaise Cable, Lyonnaise des Eaux' TV cable and communications subsidiary, aims to break even this year, Lyonnaise Cable Managing Director Cyrille Du Pelloux said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We're the leading French cable operator, our turnover will exceed one billion francs. In 1996 we broke even in the Paris region, and we aim to break even for the whole of the cable activities in 1997,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
